y\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"connection_type\": {\"value\": \"Flanged\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"minimum_straight_length_of_inlet_pipe\": {\"value\": 0, \"unit_symbol\": \"mm\", \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"minimum_straight_length_of_outlet_pipe\": {\"value\": 0, \"unit_symbol\": \"mm\", \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"flow_profile_sensitivity_class\": {\"value\": \"U0D0\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"installation_sensitivity_class\": {\"value\": \"U0 D0\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"flow_conditioner_required\": {\"value\": \"No\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"eut_testing_category\": {\"value\": \"Electromagnetic water meter\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"eut_testing_case\": {\"value\": \"Case D\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"cut_off\": {\"value\": 0.2, \"unit_symbol\": \"%\", \"unit_id\": null},\n  \"empty_pipe_detection\": {\"value\": \"on\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null}\n}\n\nHmm, cut-off 0.2% — that's a flow threshold? It's from the electronics table; fine.\n\nNow write it all out. It'll be long but fine.\n\nOne thing: in matrix table 1, description mentions MV110-only for DN≥200 and liner/temp class applicability. Good.\n\nAlso add footnote-like description: \"Q4/Q3 = 1.25 and Q2/Q1 = 1.6 for all sizes\" — already in type_level.\n\nAlso DN150 q2 value 1.56 — keep, maybe note in table description: \"DN150 class 2 Q2 is printed as 1.56 in the certificate.\" Good to flag without fabricating. I'll add that to the matrix table description.\n\nFinal check on JSON escaping: no problematic characters. Use \"–\" en dash fine.\n\nLet me write the final answer.",
